## Working in this project

This project uses **ASDD** (Agentic Spec-Driven Development). Tasks live in `bd`, not in `tasks.md` or `todo.md`. The `tasks.md` file is deprecated and a hook rejects writes to it.

- Add work: edit `specs/<slug>/spec.md`, then run `gemba spec reconcile <slug>`. For bulk imports (RFCs, planning docs, legacy tasks.md from upstream): future `gemba spec analyze <path>` will materialize them as a structured spec — for now, hand-author specs/<slug>/spec.md.
- Inspect: `gemba bead list` / `gemba bead show <id>`
- Work: `gemba run <bead>` or `gemba agent dispatch <bead>`
- Govern: `gemba spec watch <slug>` shows live status
